<contentList>
  <content contentuid="h756091eegbccag1f29g934fgc1b305661c55" version="1">Minotaur</content>
  <content contentuid="hbfad556cgf81dg220ag0573g23537cc86080" version="1">Towering, horned and relentless, minotaurs charge into battle and never lose their way.</content>
  <content contentuid="h5b9a30dagbc05gad34g3353g6c1c21a7e11a" version="1">Satyr</content>
  <content contentuid="hbcd2999cg38c4gdf3cg5c43gda06c6908ce4" version="1">Fey revelers with goat legs and curling horns, as resistant to magic as they are to sobriety.</content>
  <content contentuid="h4a0cf88eg7c5cga9edgd4eege4a9201a1950" version="1">Horns</content>
  <content contentuid="h89b890dag3808gbd1fgcd6eg86f250edf67e" version="1">Attack with your horns: [1] + Strength modifier Piercing damage.</content>
  <content contentuid="h11de2664g6fc6gc9e7gee35gca94b4a4fd52" version="1">Goring Rush</content>
  <content contentuid="h36683462g0f57g91efg6f3dg569274973be6" version="1">After you Dash, you can make a horn attack as a bonus action.</content>
  <content contentuid="h270e6489ga726gbafbgd81bg6826ee0c5da2" version="1">Hammering Horns</content>
  <content contentuid="hf93809cfgc63fg77c6gc4bagbeeeb80de357" version="1">After you hit with a melee attack, you can use a bonus action to shove the target 3m away.</content>
  <content contentuid="h7674d517g692dg767ag4144ga31c0b493741" version="1">Labyrinthine Recall</content>
  <content contentuid="h86ee3b76ga755g826bgb0ddg6ecdc987f107" version="1">You always know which way is north and have Advantage on Survival checks.</content>
  <content contentuid="h883cb880g185cg37b4gb635g55c125a0c3c8" version="1">Ram</content>
  <content contentuid="hc4e72b97gdd7ag3175g272fg1463380744ca" version="1">Headbutt with your horns: [1] + Strength modifier Bludgeoning damage.</content>
  <content contentuid="hfef64eebge240g4d29g556cg0fec0da16a73" version="1">Magic Resistance</content>
  <content contentuid="ha06936ecg03cbg2b9egbc49g83df6e6c8e33" version="1">You have Advantage on saving throws against spells.</content>
  <content contentuid="ha18b3899gfe30g934bga3aag8a06d7486d22" version="1">Mirthful Leaps</content>
  <content contentuid="hf01a37f2g9046g9fedg21a9gf75ad55552aa" version="1">Your jump distance is increased.</content>
  <content contentuid="h679fbec0g2f31g33a1gf2e5gd3e91dc1f621" version="1">Reveler</content>
  <content contentuid="hb2d4273fgf614g9cd1gd874g71dffedcc1ab" version="1">You gain proficiency in Performance, Persuasion and Musical Instruments.</content>
</contentList>
